# PostgreSQL: what the adaptation cost beside the allocator, for I1.
# One line per file: <path>  <bucket>  <why>. Buckets: allocator, compat, glue, test.
#
# The Sublet patch lives in memory-contexts/patches; what remains here is the host path.
# port/aset-capstone.patch is the capability-layout baseline, not the port.

a11trace.h                          glue     the record format, shared with the recorder in the paper repository
port/pg_printf_host.c               compat   the formatting the manager calls, on the host side
port/pg_stubs.c                     compat   the eleven libc symbols the manager references and does not use
port/stubinc/ctype.h                compat   a header the freestanding build needs to exist and not to do anything
port/stubinc/errno.h                compat   the same
port/stubinc/locale.h               compat   the same
port/stubinc/math.h                 compat   the same
port/stubinc/setjmp.h               compat   the same
port/stubinc/signal.h               compat   the same
port/stubinc/stdio.h                compat   the same
port/stubinc/stdlib.h               compat   the same
port/stubinc/string.h               compat   the same
port/stubinc/strings.h              compat   the same
port/stubinc/sys/types.h            compat   the same
tools/replay.c                      test     the replay driver
